1. gal₅-la₂ tur ka ba-a-ši-ba₉-re₆ gal₅-la₂ gu-la-ra gu₃ mu-na-de₂-e
#lem: galla[policeman]; tur[small]; kag[mouth]; bad[open]; galla[policeman]; gal[big]; gu[voice]; de[pour]
#tr.en: A small demon opened his mouth and said to the big demon, 
