2. %e ŋa₂-nam-ma-an-ze₂-en %s ur₂ kug {d}inana-ka-še₃ ga-da-re₇-en-de₃-en
#lem: men[go]V/i; ur[loin]; kug[purify]; Inanak[1]DN; ere[go (perfect plural stem of ŋen⟦to go⟧)]
#tr.en: @q[small demon,big demon]{“Come on, let's go to the lap of holy @wDN{Inana}.”} The demons entered @wSN{Unug} and seized holy @wDN{Inana}. 
#etcsl: line-id=2

3. gal₅-la₂ unug{ki}-še₃ ba-ni-in-kur₉-re-eš kug {d}inana-ke₄ mu-ni-in-dab₅-be₂-ne
#lem: galla[policeman]; Unug[1]SN; kur[enter]; kug[purify]; Inanak[1]DN; dab[seize]
#tr.en: @q[demons,Inana]{“Come on, @wDN{Inana}, 
#etcsl: line-id=3

4. ŋa₂-nu {d}inana kaskal-zu-še₃ ni-ba ŋen-na kur-še₃ ed₃-de₃
#lem: ŋen[go]; Inanak[1]DN; kaskal[way]; ni[self]; ŋen[go]; kur[mountain(s)]; ed[go up]
#tr.en: go on that journey which is yours alone -- descend to the underworld. 
#etcsl: line-id=4

5. ki šag₄-ge de₆-a-zu-še₃ ŋen-na kur-še₃ ed₃-de₃
#lem: ki[place]; šag[heart]; de[carry]; ŋen[go]; kur[mountain(s)]; ed[go up]
#tr.en: Go to the place which you have coveted -- descend to the nether world. 
#etcsl: line-id=5

6. ki {d}ereš-ki-gal-la-še₃ ŋen-na kur-še₃ ed₃-de₃
#lem: ki[place]; Ereškigalak[1]DN; ŋen[go]; kur[mountain(s)]; ed[go up]
#tr.en: Go to the dwelling of @wDN{Ereškigala} -- descend to the underworld. Don't put on your holy @fsux{ba} garment, 
#etcsl: line-id=6

7. tug₂-ba₁₃ kug {tug₂}pala₃-a tug₂ nam-nin-zu nam-ba-mu₄-mu₄-un kur-še₃ ed₃-de₃
#lem: ba[garment]; kug[purify]; pala[garment]; tug[textile]; namnin[ladyship]; mur[dress]; kur[mountain(s)]; ed[go up]
#tr.en: the @fsux{pala} dress of ladyship -- descend to the underworld. Remove the holy headdress, 
#etcsl: line-id=7

8. men kug me-te ka silim-ma saŋ-zu-a um-ta-ŋa₂-ar kur-še₃ ed₃-de₃
#lem: men[tiara]; kug[purify]; mete[appropriate thing]; kag[mouth]; silim[healthy]; saŋ[head]; ŋar[put]; kur[mountain(s)]; ed[go up]
#tr.en: that splendid ornament, from your head -- descend to the underworld. 
#etcsl: line-id=8

