#etcsl: line-id=22

23. {d}utu gu₅-li-zu ŋe₂₆-e-me-en šul-me-en za-e mu-zu
#lem: Utu[1]DN; guli[friend]; ŋaʾe[I]; šul[youth]; zaʾe[you]; zu[know]
#tr.en: I am your friend, I am a youth. Do you recognise me? 
#etcsl: line-id=23

24. nin₉-zu nam-dam-še₃ ba-an-tuku-a
#lem: nin[sister]; namdam[marriage]; tuku[acquire]
#tr.en: Your sister, whom I married, descended to the underworld. 
#etcsl: line-id=24

25. e-ne kur-še₃ ed₃-de₃
#lem: ane[he]; kur[mountain(s)]; ed[go up]
#tr.en: Because she descended to the underworld, 
#etcsl: line-id=25

26. mu e-ne kur-še₃ ed₃-de₃
#lem: mu[name]; ane[he]; kur[mountain(s)]; ed[go up]
#tr.en: it was me that she was to hand over to the underworld as a substitute. 
#etcsl: line-id=26

27. ŋe₂₆-e ki-ŋar-ra-bi ($erased EŠ₂$) kur-še₃ ba-ab-šum₂-mu-de₃
#lem: ŋaʾe[I]; kiŋara[substitute]; kur[mountain(s)]; šum[give]
#tr.en: O @wDN{Utu}, you are a just judge, don't disappoint me! 
#etcsl: line-id=27

